              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawomi abgira umukazana wiwe, at’ Uhoraho atāsizeho kugirira neza abakiriho n’abāpfuye, arakamuhezagira! Nawomi arongera aramubgira, at’ Uwo mugabo n’uwo mu muryango wacu wo hafi, n’umwe wo mu bacunguzi bacu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rusi wa Munyamowabukazi aramubarira, ati Mbere yambgiye, ati Wame ugumana n’abahungu b’i wanje, gushitsa aho bazohereza kugenya i wanje hose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawomi abarira Rusi umukazana wiwe, ati Mukobga wanje, ni vyiza k’ujana n’abigeme bamukorera, boye kugusanga mu murima w’uwundi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.22"
            ]
          }
        }
